y"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows July to August and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. In 2025, September to October ran 57% of normal and November to December 54% on the middle. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 50% of normal there. Grid 15138 had its driest year in 2005 at 53%.</p>"}
